<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.African bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 828.37 million rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Oct 4   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		     4,768.26     128,440.63</p>
<p>    - sales			   3,939.89     125,480.22</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)	 828.37	 2,960.41</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
